(3) _Direct method:_ Generate a pair of uniform deviates (\(U_{1},\ U_{2}\)). Then

\[X_{1} = \left( {- 2\ln U_{1}} \right)^{1/2}\cos 2\pi U_{2}\]

\[X_{2} = \left( {- 2\ln U_{1}} \right)^{1/2}\sin\,2\pi U_{2}\]

